   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Which of the following will not occur in response to UV exposure if a p53 mutation inactivates the p53 protein?\n\n<ol>\n  <li>Damage to DNA</li>\n  <li>p53 activation</li>\n  <li>p21 activation</li>\n  <li>Apoptosis</li>\n</ol>\n",
   "answers": [
    {
